        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{4}{9}$",
          "worked": "After a red pen is removed, nine pens remain and four of them are blue.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{blue second})&=\\frac{4}{9}\\end{align*}$$",
